      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0;">Hotel | Karawang</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Reservation:</div>
  <div class="list-item">
    The company shall direct all reservations to <span data-field="reservation_phone_1">{{ reservation_phone_1 }}</span> or direct fax <span data-field="reservation_fax">{{ reservation_fax }}</span> or email <span data-field="reservation_email">{{ reservation_email }}</span>.
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Terms & Conditions:</div>
  <ol>
    <li>Rate is applicable upon receiving advance reservation from your office. In case no prior reservation has been made, presentation of a guarantee letter from your company or company ID card is required, otherwise the published rate shall apply.</li>
    <li>Room reservation is subject to availability, therefore advance reservation is advisable.</li>
    <li>Generally the confirmed reservation will be held by hotel only until <span data-field="hold_period">{{ hold_period }}</span> local time, unless the reservation is reconfirmed by the Guarantee Letter mentioning that no show fee can be charged.</li>
    <li>For any long stay inquiry, please do not hesitate to contact us for a special arrangement</li>
  </ol>

  <div class="section-title">Cancellation and No Show Policy:</div>
  <div class="list-item">
    Cancellation and No Show without any notification on the arrival date, will be chargeable at one night charge.
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Check-In and Check - Out Procedure:</div>
  <div class="list-item">
    Check-in time is from <span data-field="check_in_time">{{ check_in_time }}</span> and check-out time is at <span data-field="check_out_time">{{ check_out_time }}</span> noon. Extension of check-out time until <span data-field="late_check_out_time">{{ late_check_out_time }}</span> hours is subject to space availability and will be charged 50% based on contract rates. Check-out after <span data-field="late_check_out_fee_time">{{ late_check_out_fee_time }}</span> hours is subject to one night room charge at contracted rate.
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Tax & Service Charge:</div>
  <div class="list-item">
    Inclusive of 21% government tax and service charge
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Billing Procedures:</div>
  <div class="list-item">
    Advance deposit is required upon check-in for personal expenses
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Term of Payment:</div>
  <ol>
    <li>Payment method must be stated at the time of booking.</li>
    <li>Payment will be made by the guest on departure, at the Hotel. By cash or accepted credit cards.</li>
    <li>In case you do not have existing credit facilities with the hotel, reservations can only be accepted with prepayment of one night deposit. Payment in full for all charges must be settled before check-out in cash or by credit card unless separate written credit arrangements have been agreed by both Parties.</li>
    <li>In the event of peak period as determined by the Hotel, the Hotel reserved the rights to request for credit card or cash to guaranteed the booking</li>
  </ol>

  <div class="section-title">Children Policy:</div>
  <ol>
    <li>Child less than 10 years of age can stay free of charge in a room occupied by the parents, using existing bedding and free breakfast.</li>
    <li>10 years and above of age can stay free of charge in a room occupied by the parents, using existing bedding and breakfast full rate.</li>
  </ol>

  <div style="font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 40px; text-align: center;">
    Managed by <span data-field="managed_by_name">{{ managed_by_name }}</span>
  </div>
</div>

